    summary: "STP938 (dencatistat) is listed on ClinicalTrials.gov in three trials sponsored by Step Pharma, SAS, all recruiting when read on 18 November 2026: a first-in-human phase 1/2 study in relapsed or refractory B-cell and T-cell lymphomas (NCT05463263, 180 participants planned, primary completion expected 2026-12), a phase 1 study in advanced solid tumours (NCT06297525) and a phase 2 study in high-risk essential thrombocythaemia (NCT06786234). The registry describes it as a small molecule and names it a CTPS1 inhibitor. No results are posted. OnCo records the agent from the registry alone; approvals, results and the sponsor's own description will follow as they are published.",
